&lt;p&gt;My name is &lt;code&gt;OXY2DEV&lt;/code&gt;(no, that&#39;s not my real name). I am a student who likes programming &amp;amp; &lt;em&gt;terminals&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; 
