&lt;p&gt;I have experience in &lt;code&gt;Lua&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;C&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Javascript&lt;/code&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;code&gt;Sass&lt;/code&gt;. I also some experience in &lt;code&gt;Bash&lt;/code&gt;. I also made simple &lt;code&gt;CLI&lt;/code&gt; apps using &lt;code&gt;NodeJs&lt;/code&gt;(not the brightest decision, I know).&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OXY2DEV/OXY2DEV/main/profile-editor.gif&quot; alt=&quot;Tinkering neovim&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;I also love ricing and tinkering!&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Also consider checking out my &lt;a href=&quot;https://oxy2dev.netlify.app/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;, though it is quite &lt;em&gt;basic&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; 
